# Self-hosted Node edge (apps/teams/edge.Dockerfile; docs/teams/private-connectivity.md 7.6a), used instead of
# the Cloudflare Worker. Put these in a 0600 env file for `docker run --env-file`.
# Also required there: SPCS_BASE, SPCS_PAT, EDGE_SESSION_SECRET, BOT_APP_ID, BOT_LINK_SECRET.

# Browser-facing https origin. Request URLs are rebuilt from it; Host headers are never trusted.
PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://<your-edge-host>
# Proxies in front that append to X-Forwarded-For (0-10). 0 uses the socket address.
# TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS=0
# PORT=8080
# HOST=0.0.0.0
# SQLite bot-link store; one replica per volume, dir 0700.
# DATA_DIR=/data
# TAB_DIST_ROOT=/app/dist
